  volume    =  211,
  number    = "Pt 17",
  pages     = "2889--2898",
  abstract  = "The present study set out to investigate the thermal limits of
               the Mediterranean bivalve Modiolus barbatus, acclimated to
               various temperatures, and includes a comparison of laboratory
               determined limits with its temperature-dependent restriction to
               deeper water layers in its natural habitat. Thermal responses and
