  publisher = "Wiley",
  volume    =  292,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "231--240",
  abstract  = "The effects of acclimation of striped bass to cold (5 degrees C)
               and warm (25 degrees C) temperatures upon ultrastructural
               features of white axial skeletal muscle are quantified. Surface
               density of sarcoplasmic reticulum (SR) increased by almost 30\%,
